  "metadata": {
    "tags": "Melodic deep house, hushed warm mid-range female lead with a close-mic male answering voice in intimate call and response; dream-pop haze and shimmering stereo; rolling four-on-the-floor at 122 BPM, vocal within 15 seconds, about 3:30; interlocking bronze Balinese gamelan metallophones, deep gongs and kendang over a warm deep bassline, near-silent gong-and-voice breakdown into a euphoric full-interlock bass drop.",
    "prompt": "[Intro: gamelan interlock, gong]\n\n[Verse 1]\nI strike the bronze, you hold the space\nYou strike it back before it fades\nAlone it's just a broken line\nTogether it keeps perfect time\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nDon't fill the silence, it belongs to you\n(Belongs to you)\nLeave me the gaps and I'll come through\n\n[Chorus]\nI play every other note\n(You play the ones between)\nNeither one of us is the song\n(The song is in the seam)\nHold the lamp behind the screen\nLet our shadows overlap\nEvery other note is mine\n(And every other one comes back)\n\n[Verse 2]\nThe lamp behind us shakes and sways\nAnd throws us larger than the stage\nYou're taller when you lean to me\nI'm closer when you let me be\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nDon't fill the silence, it belongs to you\n(Belongs to you)\nLeave me the gaps and I'll come through\n\n[Chorus]\nI play every other note\n(You play the ones between)\nNeither one of us is the song\n(The song is in the seam)\nHold the lamp behind the screen\nLet our shadows overlap\nEvery other note is mine\n(And every other one comes back)\n\n[Breakdown: only gong and voice, almost silent]\nBetween\n(Between)\nEvery other\n(Every other)\n\n[Drop: bassline returns, full gamelan interlock]\n\n[Final Chorus]\nI play every other note\n(You play the ones between)\nNeither one of us is the song\n(The song is in the seam)\n\n[Outro]\nThe song is in the seam\n[single gong, fade]",
